WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Ai, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Honto no otoko o shitteiru kai?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
Horeteru onna ni yowai sa

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Aitsu wa ore yori yasashikute

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Aitsu wa ore yori tsuyoino kai

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
Tsuki yo ga tsumetaku

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
Kokoro terasu

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
Omoi ga kage e to utsusarete

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Ai, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
<i>Al onna jounetsu omae ga kureta mono</i>

00:01:36.697 --> 00:01:37.698
It's here.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.710
I've waited a year for you!

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:55.582
No, for the five years since I left the Tower,
I've searched for you.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.117
Azalie!

00:02:00.821 --> 00:02:01.822
Master?

00:02:01.822 --> 00:02:04.558
He's talking to Bloody August!

00:02:04.558 --> 00:02:06.660
What is that sorcerer doing?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.261
Azalie?

00:02:08.762 --> 00:02:10.397
Is that a woman's name?

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:16.570
<i>The terror of BLOODY august</i>

00:02:24.411 --> 00:02:26.680
Azalie, it's me! Do you understand?

00:02:29.216 --> 00:02:33.320
The sword of Baltanders is right here,
but I can't give it to you.

00:02:34.955 --> 00:02:37.057
This won't save you!

00:02:39.226 --> 00:02:42.162
So please sleep for a while.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.167
| wonder if Bloody August can
understand human speech?

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:50.003
Forget that, what is he talking about?

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:53.073
That sorcerer is just that kind of guy.

00:02:53.073 --> 00:02:55.575
He has this habit of talking to
a lot of different things.

00:02:56.076 --> 00:02:57.144
All lies.

00:02:57.411 --> 00:02:58.345
Azalie!

00:03:04.351 --> 00:03:06.386
Spin around me, Armour of Ice!

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:12.292
Bloody August uses fire magic!

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:16.296
It can use magic? Wow!

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.498
Stop it, Azalie!

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:20.600
Have you forgotten me?

00:03:23.003 --> 00:03:24.971
| don't have the will to fight.

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:27.307
Please stop, Azalie!

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:29.443
Good going, Monster!

00:03:29.443 --> 00:03:33.613
That black sorcerer is a horrible lawbreaker!

00:03:35.282 --> 00:03:40.454
For the sake of the world, for the sake of
humanity, fry him in that nice fire!

00:03:40.721 --> 00:03:43.690
| can't believe he said that,
just because he owes him money.

00:03:51.031 --> 00:03:52.099
Master...

00:03:52.099 --> 00:03:54.434
What are you doing, black sorcerer?!

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:58.739
Your lousy magic is the only thing
that can rid us of that monster!

00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:00.040
Fight for real already!

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:03.844
Big Brother, what you've been
saying doesn't make sense.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.452
Hey, look! Look! It's coming this way!

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.888
This isn't the time to get happy, Cleao.

00:04:14.888 --> 00:04:18.058
Sir Orphen, please try harder!

00:04:23.697 --> 00:04:25.999
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:04:29.503 --> 00:04:32.105
That lame sorcerer! He missed!

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.107
No, he missed on purpose.

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:39.780
Dance around me, Towers Of Heaven!

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:44.584
Bring peace, Sleep of Atonement!

00:04:51.792 --> 00:04:52.793
He did it!

00:04:52.793 --> 00:04:55.896
Wow, that Peeping Tom is amazing!

00:04:55.896 --> 00:04:58.498
You're wrong. That is a magic of binding.

00:04:58.498 --> 00:04:59.299
Binding?

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:02.769
Master plans to capture Bloody August.

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:04.437
Why do something like that?

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:06.406
He should just hurry up and beat it!

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:12.746
A little more...

00:05:12.746 --> 00:05:14.214
Just a little more...

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.791
This is...

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:33.600
Azalie...

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.838
Azalie, don't go!

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:42.242
Please don't go!

00:05:54.287 --> 00:05:55.689
She got away.

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:59.326
Hartia, you watch the mansion.

00:05:59.326 --> 00:06:01.361
I shall return to the Tower of Fangs.

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:02.195
Yes.

00:06:05.999 --> 00:06:07.534
Master!

00:06:07.534 --> 00:06:09.236
Mister Peeping Tom!

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:12.439
Are you all right, Master?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.776
Turning Bloody August back
took some kind of magic!

00:06:16.776 --> 00:06:20.313
I've changed my mind about you, black sorcerer.
But only as much as the tip of my pinky!

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:21.481
It wasn't me.

00:06:21.982 --> 00:06:24.651
That was Childman's work.

00:06:24.651 --> 00:06:25.819
Childman?

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:31.324
Childman, the continent's ultimate
black sorcerer from the Tower of Fangs?

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:34.928
If he didn't do such unnecessary...

00:06:36.096 --> 00:06:38.365
I've waited a year, you know!

00:06:39.499 --> 00:06:40.901
For this day...

00:07:06.026 --> 00:07:08.528
Well, well, that was awful.

00:07:27.314 --> 00:07:28.648
I've finished.

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:31.584
Thank you, I'll do the rest myself.

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:34.654
Heal that which is mine, Spirit of Healing Light.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:44.898
Well, now that we're done tending to
your wounds, you can explain the situation.

00:07:44.898 --> 00:07:46.833
There's nothing for me to talk about.

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:48.268
Don't toy with us!

00:07:48.268 --> 00:07:53.406
Everyone who was there
saw you talking to that monster!

00:07:53.406 --> 00:07:54.407
Shut up.

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.744
Are you friends with that monster then?

00:07:57.744 --> 00:08:02.482
A cross between a rotten dragon and
a wild bear dropped from a cliff?

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:05.986
A covered with sewage water kind of monst-

00:08:06.453 --> 00:08:07.954
| told you to shut up, didn't I?!

00:08:07.954 --> 00:08:10.757
Wait a minute, you!
What's with your attitude?

00:08:10.757 --> 00:08:14.160
After making such a big scene
in front of someone else's home...

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.261
She's right! She's right!

00:08:15.261 --> 00:08:17.330
...you can't just not tell us anything!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.498
That's right! That's right!

00:08:19.399 --> 00:08:22.669
Well, Master, maybe, the mon-

00:08:23.503 --> 00:08:28.208
| mean Bloody August, came for that sword?

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:34.848
That's right.

00:08:36.249 --> 00:08:37.250
| thought so.

00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:42.589
| found out that the Sword of Baltanders
was here a year ago.

00:08:42.589 --> 00:08:45.825
| knew it would be dangerous
to leave it here, so I asked for it.

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:47.994
But I was refused.

00:08:48.261 --> 00:08:50.530
Refused? By who?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.698
By me.

00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:54.401
Mother!

00:08:56.669 --> 00:09:03.843
Your father bought this from an antique store
for your fifteenth birthday, Cleao.

00:09:04.177 --> 00:09:06.579
| could not do such a thing as sell it.

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:09.549
Now that you mention it, it seems like
I'd heard something like that before.

00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:10.750
Yes, I had!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.219
Your grammar doesn't make much sense, Cleao.

00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:18.124
| see. That's why you had us watch that sword.

00:09:19.159 --> 00:09:22.295
How could you keep so silent
about such dangerous circumstances?!

00:09:22.295 --> 00:09:23.863
Hey, you black sorcerer, you!

00:09:23.863 --> 00:09:25.999
There's a limit to senselessness!

00:09:26.266 --> 00:09:31.071
So for a year, you awaited the coming of
Bloody August outside the mansion.

00:09:32.205 --> 00:09:34.707
Then, it wasn't like you were
looking at my big sister,

00:09:34.707 --> 00:09:37.444
or even peeping at me while I changed!

00:09:37.444 --> 00:09:38.745
Oh dear...

00:09:39.012 --> 00:09:40.780
| didn't know...

00:09:41.281 --> 00:09:45.251
| didn't know there was such a
deep reason for Master's peeping.

00:09:48.988 --> 00:09:53.226
As long as that sword exists,
it will definitely come again.

00:09:53.827 --> 00:09:56.096
Will you let me have the sword?

00:09:56.729 --> 00:09:57.597
Yes.

00:09:57.597 --> 00:10:00.266
What?! You're going to let him have it?!

00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:02.469
That's not any fun!

00:10:02.469 --> 00:10:04.771
What are you saying, Cleao?

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:09.109
| do not want that frightening thing visiting again.

00:10:09.109 --> 00:10:10.510
Yes.

00:10:37.237 --> 00:10:41.908
Is that so? Even Childman could not defeat it?

00:10:42.408 --> 00:10:48.681
A missed chance to correct the one mistake
that could destroy the Tower,

00:10:48.681 --> 00:10:51.918
but nothing is impossible for us.

00:10:52.252 --> 00:10:57.757
To protect the honor of the Tower of Fangs,
we must have that life.

00:10:57.757 --> 00:11:00.927
Azalie, there is no hope for you.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.636
You have returned, Master Childman?

00:11:11.037 --> 00:11:12.038
Lai.

00:11:12.939 --> 00:11:14.574
| saw Krylancelo.

00:11:14.574 --> 00:11:15.909
Krylancelo?

00:11:16.176 --> 00:11:17.744
How was he doing?

00:11:19.512 --> 00:11:22.448
He hasn't changed a bit in five years.

00:11:25.919 --> 00:11:29.589
You're taking the Sword of Baltanders
and leaving on a journey tomorrow?

00:11:29.589 --> 00:11:32.926
Yes, it's bad enough if I'm
the only one attacked, you know.

00:11:32.926 --> 00:11:35.962
What an honorable thing,
especially coming from a Peeping Tom.

00:11:35.962 --> 00:11:37.830
My name is Orphen!

00:11:37.964 --> 00:11:39.766
Then, Orphen the Peeping Tom.

00:11:39.766 --> 00:11:43.369
So, that's going to stick with me forever?

00:11:43.369 --> 00:11:46.406
Well, that's okay,
because I'll never see you again.

00:11:46.839 --> 00:11:48.474
| wonder about that?

00:11:48.908 --> 00:11:50.443
What's with that face?!

00:11:50.443 --> 00:11:55.014
Hey, hey, Orphen, as a parting gift,
could you answer just this one question?

00:11:56.716 --> 00:11:58.017
Well...

00:11:58.017 --> 00:12:00.320
Do you know Bloody August?

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.088
Why were you waiting for it?

00:12:02.088 --> 00:12:04.424
What did you try to bind it instead of fighting it?

00:12:04.424 --> 00:12:08.728
You called it "Azalie."
What's that about? And then... well...

00:12:08.728 --> 00:12:09.662
Stop!

00:12:10.263 --> 00:12:13.566
That's against the contract.
There's only supposed to be one question.

00:12:14.801 --> 00:12:15.635
See you later.

00:12:15.635 --> 00:12:18.271
Master, I have a question too.

00:12:18.271 --> 00:12:22.442
Why... Why does Bloody August want that sword?

00:12:28.715 --> 00:12:32.719
That's because it wants to use this sword...

00:12:32.719 --> 00:12:34.787
to pierce its own heart.

00:13:52.932 --> 00:13:54.634
It's really true!

00:13:55.335 --> 00:14:00.540
Master really fought an equal battle
with Bloody August.

00:14:02.075 --> 00:14:06.179
| wish you could have seen
Master's big show too, Father!

00:14:06.179 --> 00:14:09.816
It wasn't a lie that he was from
the Tower of Fangs, after all!

00:14:09.816 --> 00:14:14.253
So, it's okay, right, Father?
If I go on a training journey with Master?

00:14:14.654 --> 00:14:17.423
If you really have talent,
then I won't stop you, but...

00:14:17.423 --> 00:14:20.226
How is it, Orphen? How is he at this point?

00:14:20.226 --> 00:14:22.929
| don't think this is going to be
a happy-go-lucky kind of trip.

00:14:25.064 --> 00:14:27.734
From here on out, it's not a game.

00:14:31.371 --> 00:14:32.505
Welcome.

00:14:35.775 --> 00:14:36.876
Hartia?!

00:14:40.246 --> 00:14:41.314
What'll you have?

00:14:41.314 --> 00:14:44.617
One Orphen, take out.

00:14:50.623 --> 00:14:53.226
It's been five years, hasn't it, Krylancelo?

00:14:53.226 --> 00:14:55.294
You seem well. I'm glad.

00:14:55.294 --> 00:14:58.865
I'm Orphen. I'm no longer Krylancelo.

00:15:00.032 --> 00:15:01.701
That's right, isn't it?

00:15:01.701 --> 00:15:03.469
You've changed quite a bit.

00:15:04.404 --> 00:15:07.273
No, well, but if you desire it,

00:15:07.273 --> 00:15:12.211
the Tower of Fangs will always await
a sorcerer as great as you.

00:15:13.246 --> 00:15:15.181
It seems there's something you wish to say.

00:15:15.648 --> 00:15:17.083
Yes, I do.

00:15:17.083 --> 00:15:19.385
Tell this to Childman!

00:15:19.385 --> 00:15:21.187
Don't get in my way again!

00:15:21.187 --> 00:15:25.725
If he hadn't put in his unwanted two cents,
then I could have bound Azalie!

00:15:26.092 --> 00:15:29.495
If it could be bound,
then it would have been so long since.

00:15:29.495 --> 00:15:30.430
What?

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.331
If nothing else, it's too much for you.

00:15:32.331 --> 00:15:34.967
So... kill it?

00:15:36.869 --> 00:15:40.506
Orphen, where is the Sword of Baltanders?

00:15:40.506 --> 00:15:41.974
Who knows?

00:15:41.974 --> 00:15:44.844
Hand the sword over to the Tower of Fangs,

00:15:44.844 --> 00:15:47.346
and have no further contact with her.

00:15:47.713 --> 00:15:51.250
Don't make the Tower of Fangs your enemy!
That is for your sake also.

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.654
And if I say I don't want to?

00:15:54.654 --> 00:15:57.690
Azalie will appear for that sword again.

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:59.759
Even if you wield it,
you won't be able to save her.

00:15:59.759 --> 00:16:02.161
Save? Save, you say?

00:16:06.799 --> 00:16:10.069
Don't make me laugh!
You don't even want to save her!

00:16:10.069 --> 00:16:13.606
It's just me! I'm the only one
who wants to save Azalie! Just me!

00:16:14.307 --> 00:16:15.308
Orphen...

00:16:19.479 --> 00:16:23.149
Orphen, I think of you as a true friend.

00:16:23.149 --> 00:16:24.417
| think so too.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.486
You're tired.

00:16:26.486 --> 00:16:28.521
It would be good for you to rest a while.

00:16:28.521 --> 00:16:30.156
In a hospital bed.

00:16:30.156 --> 00:16:33.125
Go ahead and try! If you think you can!

00:16:33.125 --> 00:16:34.060
O, Darkness!

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:35.928
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:16:49.075 --> 00:16:53.713
Come to think of it, why do |
have to do something like this?

00:16:53.713 --> 00:16:56.048
Big Brother is the one in debt,

00:16:56.649 --> 00:17:00.319
and the one who wants
the loan paid is that sorcerer.

00:17:00.887 --> 00:17:03.189
What am |, then?

00:17:03.189 --> 00:17:05.625
Yes, yes. I understand, Dortin.

00:17:05.625 --> 00:17:07.960
| really understand how you feel.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.097
The real bad guy is that runny-nose sorcerer!

00:17:11.097 --> 00:17:15.334
Be afraid! Someday I'll
strangle you to death from afar!

00:17:15.701 --> 00:17:17.637
There's no way you'd win.

00:17:18.437 --> 00:17:20.106
Insolence!

00:17:21.908 --> 00:17:25.912
I'm so silly, making mistaken assumptions
on no basis at all.

00:17:26.779 --> 00:17:29.582
| guess there was no red string
between that person and myself.

00:17:29.582 --> 00:17:32.985
Yes, yes. No red string and no relation.

00:17:32.985 --> 00:17:34.887
I'm relieved that he's gone.

00:17:35.321 --> 00:17:39.759
| shall continue to pray for his happiness,
and I will give him up.

00:17:39.759 --> 00:17:45.031
Yes, yes. It's better if you think of it as
a bad dream, and forget about it.

00:17:45.031 --> 00:17:48.401
Even if I went with him, I'd just be a bother.

00:17:48.401 --> 00:17:52.905
Yes, yes. To begin with,
you live in different worlds.

00:17:52.905 --> 00:17:55.575
My, you think so too, Cleao?

00:17:55.575 --> 00:17:57.209
Of course!

00:17:57.209 --> 00:18:00.813
Like you'd go even if he asked. Never!

00:18:01.514 --> 00:18:02.415
Yes?

00:18:02.415 --> 00:18:04.150
Excuse me!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:10.523
We've gathered the travel goods
Miss Cleao requested of us.

00:18:15.261 --> 00:18:16.195
Travel?

00:18:16.195 --> 00:18:19.632
Yes... Well... That is...

00:18:19.632 --> 00:18:24.437
That sorcerer is staying at
the hotel tonight, and tomor-

00:18:26.072 --> 00:18:29.241
Cleao, you can't possibly...

00:18:31.077 --> 00:18:34.680
You found me out, but you see...

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:37.783
It seems like it'd be a whole bunch of fun
to go with him, doesn't it?

00:18:43.356 --> 00:18:44.857
What's that?

00:19:10.516 --> 00:19:12.218
The Hand of Darkness, is it?

00:19:13.019 --> 00:19:14.353
Where is he?

00:19:15.321 --> 00:19:16.856
Where are you?

00:19:21.527 --> 00:19:23.863
Blade of Satan, whom I call forth!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.986
This is just how Hartia planned it.

00:19:48.054 --> 00:19:50.356
Cloak me, Steps of the Sorcerer!

00:19:56.929 --> 00:19:58.197
There you are!

00:19:59.565 --> 00:20:01.634
Guide me, O Starling of Death!

00:20:19.885 --> 00:20:23.222
S-such is Master Childman's favored pupil.

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:25.791
As is Childman's right arm.

00:20:26.358 --> 00:20:27.860
How ironic.

00:20:28.427 --> 00:20:32.264
That we should be here like this when we
polished our art under the same Master.

00:20:32.264 --> 00:20:34.567
I'm not in the mood to hear your laments.

00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:35.735
Here I come, Hartia!

00:20:35.968 --> 00:20:36.902
<i>Come!</i>

00:20:43.642 --> 00:20:44.944
This is...

00:20:45.111 --> 00:20:46.112
It can't be!

00:20:46.112 --> 00:20:47.713
Master!

00:20:48.247 --> 00:20:49.081
Majic...

00:20:49.081 --> 00:20:50.583
Master!

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:52.718
It's terrible!

00:20:53.252 --> 00:20:54.553
Cleao!

00:20:54.553 --> 00:20:56.155
Cleao and Miss Mariabelle!

00:20:56.155 --> 00:20:57.123
What?!

00:21:12.138 --> 00:21:13.506
Damn...

00:21:19.478 --> 00:21:21.580
What? Bloody August?

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.414
Yes.

00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:25.751
Hartia, why did you leave the mansion?

00:21:25.751 --> 00:21:28.287
| suspected this might happen
when I left you there.

00:21:29.488 --> 00:21:30.322
Master!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.959
Bloody August is not
an ordinary sorcerous monster.

00:21:33.959 --> 00:21:36.796
It is the ultimate monster,
with human intelligence.

00:21:40.833 --> 00:21:44.236
Most probably, no trace of Azalie's reason
and conscience are left in it.

